+# Xbox private error-log layout gate
+
+This check compiles the maintained `classp.h` with the flags and generated
+headers from a configured production Xbox build. It catches accidental ring
+reintroduction, an allocation crossing the 1024-byte pool class, changes to
+generic release/debug ring layout, and compiled Xbox ring consumers.
+
+Build `classpnp` first, then run inside the same compiler environment:
+
+```sh
+python3 tests/host/class-errorlog-layout/check.py /path/to/build /path/to/evidence
+```
+
+The generic compatibility checks use the unchanged header's independently
+recorded 32-bit NTDDI_WIN8 release/debug sizes and offsets with `SARCH_XBOX`
+removed. They retain the production ReactOS/compiler definitions. The gate
+does not claim to compile a full generic kernel or measure boot memory.
+The Xbox debug packet log is separate and remains present.
diff --git a/tests/host/class-errorlog-layout/check.py b/tests/host/class-errorlog-layout/check.py
